/?book=11&chapter=4&verse=28\">1இரா 4:28</a>; <a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=7&chapter=7&verse=13\">நியா 7:13</a>; <a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=43&chapter=6&verse=5\">யோவா 6:5</a>; <a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=43&chapter=6&verse=13\">யோவா 6:13</a>)"},{"paragraph":"10. <a class=\"link-dictionary-word\" href=\"?word=பச்சை-மரம்\">பச்சைமரம்</a> - Bay Tree (<a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=19&chapter=37&verse=35\">சங் 37:35</a>)"},{"paragraph":"11. <a class=\"link-dictionary-word\" href=\"?word=பயறு\">பயறு</a> - Beans (<a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=26&chapter=4&verse=9\">எசே 4:9</a>)"},{"paragraph":"12. புன்னை <a class=\"link-dictionary-word\" href=\"?word=மரம்\">மரம்</a> - Box Tree (<a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=23&chapter=60&verse=13\">ஏசா 60:13</a>; <a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=23&chapter=41&verse=17\">ஏசா 41:17-20</a>)"},{"paragraph":"13. சூரைச்செடி - Broom (<a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=19&chapter=120&verse=4\">சங் 120:4</a>; <a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=11&chapter=19&verse=4\">1இரா 19:4-5</a>; <a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=18&chapter=30&verse=4\">யோபு 30:4</a>; <a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=24&chapter=17&verse=6\">எரே 17:6</a>; <a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=24&chapter=48&verse=6\">எரே 48:6</a>)"},{"paragraph":"14. <a class=\"link-dictionary-word\" href=\"?word=வசம்பு\">வசம்பு</a> - Calamus (<a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=22&chapter=4&verse=1