4&chapter=19&verse=6\">எண் 19:6</a>)"},{"paragraph":"18. <a class=\"link-dictionary-word\" href=\"?word=லவங்கம்\">லவங்கம்</a> - Cinnamon (<a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=2&chapter=30&verse=23\">யாத் 30:23</a>; <a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=20&chapter=7&verse=17\">நீதி 7:17</a>; <a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=66&chapter=18&verse=13\">வெளி 18:13</a>)"},{"paragraph":"19. வாசனைக்கட்டை - Citron (<a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=66&chapter=18&verse=12\">வெளி 18:12</a>)"},{"paragraph":"20. <a class=\"link-dictionary-word\" href=\"?word=வெள்ளரிக்காய்\">வெள்ளரிக்காய்</a> - Cucumber (<a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=4&chapter=11&verse=5\">எண் 11:5</a>)"},{"paragraph":"21. <a class=\"link-dictionary-word\" href=\"?word=சீரகம்\">சீரகம்</a> - Cummin (<a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=23&chapter=28&verse=25\">ஏசா 28:25</a>; <a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=23&chapter=28&verse=27\">ஏசா 28:27</a>; <a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=40&chapter=23&verse=23\">மத் 23:23</a>)"},{"paragraph":"22. தேவதாரு - Cypress (<a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=23&chapter=44&verse=14\">ஏசா 44:14</a>; <a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=23&chapter=55&verse=13\">ஏசா 55:13</a>; <a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=23&chapter=44&verse=14\">ஏசா 44:14</a>)"},{"paragraph":"23. <a class=\"link-dictionary-word\" href=\"?word=புறா\">புறாக்களுக்குப்</a> போடுகிற <a class=\"link-dictionary-word\" href=\"?word=பயறு\">பயறு</a> - Dove Droppings (<a class=\"link-bible-reference\" href=\"https://www.wordofgod.in/bibles/?book=1